		(uuid "3da443f5-fa11-49f9-b3b9-68969d3374e6")
		(at 113.414999 113.414999)
		(descr "Taoglas GVLB258.A single-feed stacked L1/L5 ceramic patch, 25x25x8.12 mm, feed pin 0.8 mm on the centre line 2.5 mm off centre. Land and clearances per datasheet SPE-21-8-082-G sec. 4.2-4.3: 1.0 mm plated hole, 2.2 mm bottom (solder-side) pad; the top (antenna-side) and inner pads are 1.4 mm, not the datasheet's 1.2, for a 0.20 mm annular ring (JLC PTH minimum 0.15 mm), as on the GVLB208.A; no-copper areas unchanged; no copper within 3.0 mm dia on the top and inner layers, 3.5 mm dia on the bottom. Tuned by Taoglas on a 70x70 mm ground plane (https://www.taoglas.com/datasheets/GVLB258.A.pdf)")
